// Port specific: Windows executable resource script.
// Supplies the application icon shown in Explorer / the taskbar for
// fruit-ninja.exe. Compiled by the MSVC (rc.exe) or MinGW (windres)
// resource compiler and linked into the exe. No binary counterpart.
//
// Icon ID 1 -> the shell uses the lowest-numbered ICON as the app icon.
1 ICON "fruit-ninja.ico"
